<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-marble="1">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="marble:capabilities" content="storage; net=none">
<title>__TITLE__</title>
<style>
  /* The Marble design system's palette, with one change the system does not
     make: a document is white to the edge. The off-white paper belongs to
     the interface — the Drive itself — not to the thing you are writing in.
     One dusty blue does all the accenting, the same blue in every starter,
     because five colours would be five claims and there is only one. */
  :root {
    --ink: #111111;
    --muted: #5a5a5a;
    --line: #ddd9cf;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --note: #e1e9f1;
    --accent: #9bb6cf;
    --accent-soft: #f1f5f8;
    --accent-ink: #738698;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --ink: #e8e6e1; --muted: #a3a7ab; --line: #2f3438;
      --paper: #1c1f22; --card: #1c1f22; --note: #22303a;
      --accent: #7fa8c9; --accent-soft: #1d2932; --accent-ink: #9dc0dc;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  header { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto .9rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 .2rem; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: .95rem; }

  .board {
    position: relative; max-width: 60rem; height: 34rem; margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
    background-image: radial-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 90%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 16px 16px; overflow: hidden;
    /* A finger dragging a note should move the note, not scroll the page. */
    touch-action: none;
  }
  .note {
    position: absolute; width: 12rem; min-height: 5.5rem; padding: .65rem .75rem;
    background: var(--note); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.09);
  }
  .note h3 { font-size: .85rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .note p { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  [data-marble-editable] { outline: none; border-radius: 3px; }
  [data-marble-editable]:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  [data-marble-editable]:focus { background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent), 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft); }
  .bar { max-width: 60rem; margin: .75rem auto 0; }
  .add {
    appearance: none; padding: .45rem .9rem; border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 999px;
    background: none; color: var(--muted); font: 500 .85rem/1 inherit; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .add:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header data-marble-id="__ID__">
  <h1 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>__TITLE__</h1>
  <p class="lede" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Drag a note anywhere. Where it is written as an inline style on the note itself — one attribute in the file, not a table of coordinates beside it.</p>
</header>

<div class="board" data-marble-id="__ID__" id="board" data-marble-canvas>

  <div class="note" data-marble-id="__ID__" style="left:32px;top:28px" data-marble-removable>
    <h3 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Start here</h3>
    <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Move me. Then open this file in a text editor and find the number that changed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="note" data-marble-id="__ID__" style="left:272px;top:132px" data-marble-removable>
    <h3 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>A second note</h3>
    <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>A canvas answers <em>where</em>, which a list has no way to say.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="bar" data-marble-transient>
  <button class="add" data-marble-add="#tpl-note" data-marble-into="#board">+ note</button>
</div>

<template id="tpl-note" data-marble-transient>
  <div class="note" style="left:64px;top:64px" data-marble-removable>
    <h3 data-marble-editable>New note</h3>
    <p data-marble-editable>Say something, then move it.</p>
  </div>
</template>

__SCRIPT__
</body>
</html>
